            "review_title": "Review at Mượt Smooth And Chill",
            "review_text": "AJ0312\n10 contributions\n0\nHidden gem\nJul 2026 • Couples\nThe restaurant is a little far from the Ninh Kieu city center and hidden in a small alley, but it has a really relaxing atmosphere. The food was delicious with a nice fusion style, and the staff were very friendly and welcoming. The only downside was that there wasn't an English menu when I visited, as the restaurant mainly serves local customers.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 24, 2026",
