            "review_text": "Thao L\n3 contributions\n0\nA Must-Visit Cozy Bar & Restaurant in Can Tho!\nNov 2024 • Friends\nIf you’re visiting Can Tho, don’t miss out on this cozy bar and restaurant that’s perfect for any occasion. With both indoor and outdoor seating, it offers a warm and inviting atmosphere ideal for celebrating with friends or a special someone. The menu features a delightful fusion of traditional and modern Vietnamese dishes, including must-tries like Lap Xuong and Nem Chua Ran. The staff are friendly and attentive, always ready to enhance your experience with their local insights and recommendations for exploring Can Tho. It’s a must-visit spot for delicious food and great vibes!\nRead more\nWritten November 23, 2024",
